      "updated": 1787053062047,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Resilience on External Integrations\nAll outbound calls to Shopify (RMA), Stripe (Refunds) and 3PL carriers are wrapped with:\nTimeouts  +  Exponential Backoff with Jitter  +  Circuit Breakers\nso a 3rd-party outage never crashes the agent response loop.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Resilience on External Integrations\nAll outbound calls to Shopify (RMA), Stripe (Refunds) and 3PL carriers are wrapped with:\nTimeouts  +  Exponential Backoff with Jitter  +  Circuit Breakers\nso a 3rd-party outage never crashes the agent response loop.",
