      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788373033423,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Returns, stock updates, refunds\n  require strict accuracy\n• Verify return window < 30 days\n• Verify refund threshold < $50\n  before auto-approval\n• Prefer single-node / strongly\n  consistent store (e.g. Spanner,\n  DynamoDB strong-read mode)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Returns, stock updates, refunds\n  require strict accuracy\n• Verify return window < 30 days\n• Verify refund threshold < $50\n  before auto-approval\n• Prefer single-node / strongly\n  consistent store (e.g. Spanner,\n  DynamoDB strong-read mode)",
