      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b0q",
      "text": "• conversations(user_id, created_at)\n• orders(order_id) · orders(user_id, ts)\n• Ordered + 1-dimensional: exact match,\n   range scans AND ORDER BY all served\n• Keeps auth + chat-history fetch inside\n   p50 < 1s / p95 < 2.5s\n• Hash index not used: equality only,\n   no range, no sort",
      "originalText": "• conversations(user_id, created_at)\n• orders(order_id) · orders(user_id, ts)\n• Ordered + 1-dimensional: exact match,\n   range scans AND ORDER BY all served\n• Keeps auth + chat-history fetch inside\n   p50 < 1s / p95 < 2.5s\n• Hash index not used: equality only,\n   no range, no sort",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
