      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b0t",
      "text": "• Full-text keyword retrieval over past\n   support tickets, customer emails and\n   product names\n• Postgres FTS (GIN) for a small corpus,\n   Elasticsearch / Lucene at scale\n• term → posting list of doc ids, BM25\n   ranked; complements the Vector DB's\n   semantic recall with exact keywords",
      "originalText": "• Full-text keyword retrieval over past\n   support tickets, customer emails and\n   product names\n• Postgres FTS (GIN) for a small corpus,\n   Elasticsearch / Lucene at scale\n• term → posting list of doc ids, BM25\n   ranked; complements the Vector DB's\n   semantic recall with exact keywords",
      "fontSize": 14,
