      "updated": 1787144207106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "index": "b0w",
      "text": "• Find nearest drop-off point or\n   fulfilment centre from customer lat/long\n• Geohash (Redis) for proximity buckets,\n   R-Tree / PostGIS for polygon + range\n• Replaces an O(n) distance scan over\n   every location with a bounded lookup\n• Feeds the 3PL Carrier API step of the\n   return Saga",
      "originalText": "• Find nearest drop-off point or\n   fulfilment centre from customer lat/long\n• Geohash (Redis) for proximity buckets,\n   R-Tree / PostGIS for polygon + range\n• Replaces an O(n) distance scan over\n   every location with a bounded lookup\n• Feeds the 3PL Carrier API step of the\n   return Saga",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "EnbxkKu5GwGow2X3CgQID",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 635.9258930749274,
      "y": 2173.8590150120854,
      "width": 1172,
      "height": 18,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
