      "index": "b12",
      "text": "• hash(user_id | client IP) → Redis cluster\n   ring with virtual nodes\n• A user always maps to the same counter\n   shard → sticky, correct rate limiting\n• Idempotency / dedup keys for retried\n   requests stay co-located\n• Peak-season scale-out remaps ~K/N keys\n   only — no cache thrash or stampede",
      "originalText": "• hash(user_id | client IP) → Redis cluster\n   ring with virtual nodes\n• A user always maps to the same counter\n   shard → sticky, correct rate limiting\n• Idempotency / dedup keys for retried\n   requests stay co-located\n• Peak-season scale-out remaps ~K/N keys\n   only — no cache thrash or stampede",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
